<p>Thank you, I am going to try again.</p>
<p>Seeking Greenlights: Yes</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: Normal elevator that when all the buttons are pushed it takes you to a world where humans are extinct.</p>
<p>Central Narrative:</p>
<ul>
<li>Pushing all the buttons on this elevator causes the elevator and everything inside to get sent to a parallel universe.</li>
<li>In said universe; humans have been eradicated due to an unknown entity.</li>
<li>Any person who steps out of the elevator are met with an apocalyptic scene; a perpetual red haze in every direction, hollowed out husks of cars litter the streets, glass strewn across the road.</li>
<li>At first, every human they meet are long since dead, only skeletons remain.</li>
<li>The first living human they meet turns out to be from another alternate universe very similar to ours.</li>
<li>The other human leads them to a group of humans living in a bunker, hiding from the mysterious entity (SCP-XXXX-1).</li>
<li>These other humans are trying to fix the matching elevator from their alternate realities.</li>
<li>The human that just arrived has a degree in mechanics and fixes the elevator.</li>
<li>The humans step one after another into the elevator and pushes all the buttons and are sent back to their universe.</li>
<li>Just as the last 2 human are about to step into the elevator, SCP-XXXX-1 shows itself: a billowing swirl of red smoke, and &quot;grabs&quot; the closest human and the other human hears their screams as he is sent back to his universe.</li>
</ul>
<p>Hook/Attention-Grabber: Don't push all the buttons… or else…</p>

